# Scope agent search away from build artifacts and generated files.
# These are large, machine-generated, or vendored — reading them wastes context.

# Dependencies & build output
node_modules/
.next/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated code / maps (regenerate via npm scripts; never hand-read)
frontend/src/types/database.types.ts
docs/architecture/PROJECT-MAP.md
docs/architecture/TABLE-LIST.md

# Lockfiles
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json

# Local AI-layer artifacts (generated by hooks / validator)
.claude/claude-md-review.md
.claude/ai-layer-validation.md

# Vendored local tooling
claude-memory-compiler-main/

# Misc
.git/
*.log
verify-output/
